  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Rock, Paper, Scissors Game</h2>\n<p>The game being played is rock, paper, scissors, with three rounds being mentioned multiple times. The items used in the game are paper, and the names of the players are Aiko. They are starting a new game, and Aiko is playing rock, paper, scissors. They are also adjusting the distance between the players.</p>\n<h2>Popopopi&#x27;s Response to Song Recommendations</h2>\n<p>Popopopi took the request for song recommendations very seriously. The response from Popopopi was described as sounding like a robot and very professional, implying a job-like demeanor. Popopopi requested feedback before providing a response, and the tone was described as very professional. There was some uncertainty about whether the response was from Popopopi, but anticipation for feedback was expressed. It was also mentioned that it&#x27;s okay if the interaction is light or casual.</p>\n<h2>Future Plans and Audience Interaction</h2>\n<p>The speaker expressed hope that the audience will continue to support them and watch future videos, especially after new outfits are revealed. They also mentioned plans to chat with the audience and read superchats after the performance, along with showcasing new outfits. The speaker expressed a desire to spend the rest of the day with the audience, having fun and enjoying a relaxed time together.</p>\n<h2>Plans to Play Miiiinside</h2>\n<p>They are planning to play the game Miiiinside. The speaker initially worried about the availability of Miiiinside but is now excited about it as it is considered a trend. The speaker is concerned about the game&#x27;s complexity and compares it to another game, Advent. The speaker finds the situation familiar and is eagerly anticipating the event.</p>\n<h2>General Reactions and Excitement</h2>\n<p>There were general agreements and affirmations, as well as expressions of excitement about upcoming events, such as a super challenge on the 19th.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GzDt2x1x6dM</p>",
